sequenceDiagram
    participant PO as Platform Operator
    participant Issuer as KYC/Identity Issuer
    participant Deployer as Deployer/SPV
    participant Investor as Investor
    
    Note over PO: Initial Platform Setup
    PO->>+PO: Deploy IdentityRegistry
    PO->>+PO: Deploy ClaimTopicsRegistry
    PO->>+PO: Deploy TrustedIssuersRegistry
    PO->>+PO: Deploy Factory Contracts
    
    Note over PO,Issuer: Issuer Registration
    PO->>+PO: Register Issuer in TrustedIssuersRegistry
    
    Note over Deployer: Property Tokenization
    Deployer->>+Deployer: Deploy RealEstateSecurityManager
    Deployer->>+Deployer: Deploy ERC-3643 Token
    Deployer->>+Deployer: Deploy DividendManager
    Deployer->>+Deployer: Deploy VestingManager
    Deployer->>+Deployer: Fund Redemption Reserve
    
    Note over Deployer,PO: Integration
    Deployer->>+PO: Register with Platform Registries
    PO->>+Deployer: Set Platform as Fee Recipient
    
    Note over Investor,Issuer: Investor Onboarding
    Investor->>+Investor: Create ONCHAINID
    Investor->>+Issuer: Complete KYC
    Issuer->>+Investor: Add KYC Claim (Topic 42)
    
    Note over Investor,Deployer: Investment Process
    Investor->>+Deployer: Send USDC for Tokens
    Deployer->>+Investor: Mint Tokens via RealEstateSecurityManager
    Deployer->>+Deployer: Register in VestingManager